cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use IMITATOR, please cite it using the metadata from this file,
  and in particular the preferred citation below.
title: IMITATOR
abstract: >-
  IMITATOR is an open source software tool to perform automated parameter
  synthesis for concurrent timed systems. It relies on the formalism of
  networks of parametric timed automata, augmented with rational-valued
  global variables, stopwatches, multi-rate clocks, and other features.
type: software
authors:
